The three bundled fonts are not covered by the licence above. They are subsets
of upstream families, redistributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and
each keeps its upstream notice verbatim beside the file:

  packages/ui/src/fonts/sans/    Instrument Sans, OFL 1.1, packages/ui/src/fonts/sans/OFL.txt
  packages/ui/src/fonts/serif/   Newsreader, OFL 1.1, packages/ui/src/fonts/serif/OFL.txt
  packages/ui/src/fonts/mono/    JetBrains Mono, OFL 1.1, packages/ui/src/fonts/mono/OFL.txt

Subsetting is a modification, and the OFL reserves the original family name for
unmodified versions, so the subsets ship under renamed families: To-Hoot Sans,
To-Hoot Serif and To-Hoot Mono. See scripts/fetch-fonts.sh.
